{"lyrics":"[00:03.12]Ayy, ayy, ayy-ayy-ayy\n[00:10.30]Yeah, yeah-yeah\n[00:14.18]Ayy, ayy\n[00:14.50]Who am I? Bitch, who are you? (J. Knight On The Beat)\n[00:19.10]Who am I? Bitch, who are you? Haha, ayy\n[00:26.48]I just had to hit that light switch you feel me, haha\n[00:30.66]Yuh, yuh, yuh, ayy, swoo', oh, I got high for this one\n[00:38.08]Ayy, with the gang, in my lane, boy I never change, ayy\n[00:43.88]I'm the same, I'm the same, I be with the gang, ayy, haha\n[00:49.84]Pop a Xan just to ease the pain, ayy, haha\n[00:54.56]Blow you down in your fucking game, wait, ayy\n[00:59.44]Who are you? Who the fuck are you? ayy\n[01:03.02]Tie the knot, with the Glock, like a fucking shoe, ayy\n[01:07.88]Boy I heard you got that pole, but you won't fucking shoot, ayy\n[01:12.74]I may kill you and your moms, I don't got shit to lose, ayy\n[01:18.32]I am lunatic, I go crazy with the stupidness\n[01:22.30]I'm a wild fucking hooligan\n[01:24.62]Yeah, it's Juice, let the Uzi spit (J. Knight On The Beat)\n[01:27.16]I might fuck a bitch then kick her out\n[01:28.94]I'ma show you what this business 'bout\n[01:31.66]Your bitch gon' know what the dick about\n[01:34.04]Your team gon' know what my clip about\n[01:36.70]Ayy, ayy, damn it, I'd do it again\n[01:41.46]Ayy, ayy, Juice went to shoot it again, ayy\n[01:46.46]I'm in the booth going stupid, I came in here, yeah, I got crews and we win, ayy\n[01:51.04]Came with the Ruger again, boy, you don't got no damn shooters again, ayy\n[01:57.12]Now I ain't come to shoot the one, bitch, haha\n[02:01.86]But, I'm still shooting some shit, ayy\n[02:05.48]Boy I hate bitches, they just make assumptions\n[02:10.28]Making something, out of nothing, ayy\n[02:15.96]Now what sense do that make, ayy\n[02:19.72]I got this work, hard rock, earthquake, ayy\n[02:24.40]I whip the pot, and then I make the earth shake, ayy\n[02:28.82]Should've never came here in the first place, ayy, ayy\n[02:34.22]Blow your candles out, happy birthday, ayy, ayy\n[02:3